The shape stack is ported from weaveworks-ui-components/GraphNode and has been
modified. Specifically:

    src/shapes/Shape.tsx
        curvedUnitPolygonPath, ported from GraphNode/shapes/_Shape.js

    src/shapes/BaseShape.tsx
        the layered highlight -> background -> metric -> shadow -> border ->
        anchor composition, ported from GraphNode/shapes/_BaseShape.js and
        simplified

    src/shapes/Shape{Circle,Cloud,Cylinder,Heptagon,Hexagon,Octagon,Pentagon,
                     Sheet,Square,Triangle}.tsx
        the shape set follows the upstream set and composes the two files above

These files differ from their originals: they are TypeScript rather than
JavaScript, they render through a props contract this package defines rather
than upstream's, and the compositing layers were reduced.

The rest of the package is original work and is not derived from
weaveworks-ui-components:

    the Semantic Link envelope and its encoding into stroke, dash, hue and
    opacity; the projection registry and layout; the filter; the decision
    trace; the canvas host and its fit-to-extent behavior; the type surface.
